  faqs: { en: [
    { q: "Where is the news notifications setting in Tradovate?", a: "Open Application Settings from the top-right corner, select the Preferences tab, and scroll to the Notifications section. The news notifications toggle sits there alongside the order and ticker controls. Confirm the exact label in your current build, since wording can change between updates." },
